  id: cluck
  displayName: Cluck
  description: Small bird-like creature. Lays eggs. Common around any settled area.
  behaviors:
  - Stays close to where it spawned.
  - Easy to catch by hand.
  - Lays eggs in nests if kept in Animal Pen.
  - Cluck calls attract more Clucks.
  habitat: Lowlands Fauna
  dropItemIds:
  - Egg x1 (passive)
  - Poultry x1-2 (if killed)
  - Feather x2-3
